 ---------------------- THE PARAMETERS ----------------------------
tree file is: phylo/afp_Afp2.r4s.nwk
seq file is: orthology/afp_sf1_afp2_like.afa
output file is: rates/afp_Afp2.res
reference sequence is: REF
rate inference method is: empirical Bayesian estimate
using a Gamma prior distribution with: 16 discrete categories
probablistic_model is: WAG
branch lengths optimization is ML using a gamma model

